purposes. And we wouldn't talk about a bicycle in an airplane as doing the same thing. And ed tech is exactly the same way. So important to all you great listeners out there is that, you know, what Kim and I are going to be talking about today, you know, are those technologies that are intended and marketed for learning. Now, that application that your son was using during COVID, and you mentioned and you thought it looked like a game, that was a kind of ed tech, but was it, was it good? Apparently not. And no, I will not name the app that he was using. But I will tell you this. It was intended for learning. And it was being, you know, assigned as a homework assignment. you know, by his teachers. And so that is, is really what, you know, for years just stuck with me

